# Anchor vault .gitignore
#
# Ignore OS and editor scratch only. Everything else in this repo is source of truth.
#
# NOT ignored, on purpose:
#   data/reviews/*.jsonl   review log written by the apps — the only copy of your history
#   data/insights.json     derived state the apps keep alongside it
# Both are committed. Never add them here, and never delete them: entries whose card
# was deleted are kept forever by design.

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Linux
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

# Editor scratch
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.#*

# Obsidian per-machine UI state (the rest of .obsidian/ is worth committing).
# Uncomment if you open this vault on more than one machine.
#.obsidian/workspace.json
#.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
